      444.39,
      542.48,
      591.53
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the scheduled dates for the annual Esala Festival and procession of Seenigama Sri Maha Devol Devalaya situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of Seenigama, Divisional Secretary's Division of Madampagama of the District of Galle, Southern Province, published in the Government Gazette Extraordinary No. 2390/15 dated Thursday the 27th of June, 2024, as per the Provisions of the Pilgrimages Ordinance, is hereby amended and will be held from Thursday the 29th of August, 2024 to Thursday the 05th of September, 2024. W. A. Dharmasiri, District Secretary/Government Agent, Administrative District, Galle. at the District Secretariat, Galle,17th of July, 2024.",
